      "An old military postcard addressed in cursive handwriting. It is printed on a light, bark‑like background and bears postal markings and a stamp in the upper right corner. The left side has a faint circular postmark. Romanian text indicates it is a \"Carte poştală militară\" (military postcard) and includes the recipient's name and town."
